+Verification used pinned Node 22.23.4, installed Vitest with one worker, sealed fake environment values, empty HOME, network denial and finite 120-second/8-MiB child bounds. Three source regressions reproduced the predecessor limitations. Final affected checks passed: 121 tests across eight files, scoped ESLint and Prettier, with stable source hashes. Existing historical assertions and profile goldens remain; explicit current bridges cover the changed pins. A prior whole-profile-file view remains frozen, and a new exact whole-file comparison covers both successor hashes. Independent A12/Build vectors join the unchanged legacy vectors. These are source/byte/model controls, not SQL execution or race proof.
